# poolside Laguna-S-2.1 (118B-A8B MoE) Q4-lean (67 GiB), 256K context, llama.cpp-tip Vulkan (branch laguna-gfx1151) with
# Strix Halo fork Mesa. Set GGML_VK_FA_KV_SLICE=4096 (prefill +23% @128K) and LLAMA_SPARSE_ATTN=64,64,16384
# (block-sparse decode: 26.4 tok/s @128K, 24.2 @245K vs 19.5 / 15.0 dense). ~31-34 tok/s short context. Agentic 5/5,
# needle 14-15/15. Full record: laguna/README.md.
MODEL_SOURCE="-m /models/Laguna-S-2.1-Q4-lean/Laguna-S-2.1-Q4-lean-00001-of-00003.gguf"
MODEL_ALIAS=poolside/Laguna-S-2.1
# MODEL_IMAGE: a llama-server build of llama.cpp a8c9a4e7c + patches/llama.cpp (Vulkan); env vars in the model README
# --cache-ram 0: no host prompt cache (memory pressure). Sampling as benchmarked (temp 1.0, top-k 20).
MODEL_ARGS="--n-gpu-layers 999 --flash-attn on -fit off --load-mode none --parallel 1 --ctx-size 262144 -ctk q8_0 -ctv q8_0 --ubatch-size 4096 --batch-size 4096 --cache-ram 0 --jinja --temp 1.0 --top-p 1.0 --top-k 20 --min-p 0.0"
